Nine files, AGPL-3.0-or-later. These are MiaAI Lab's patch output from
MiaAI-Lab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Single-DGX-Spark (AGPL-3.0-or-later), whose
generators reproduce all nine files byte-for-byte; they are not our
engineering. Some lines they patch are Apache-2.0 vLLM work (PRs #53899,
#53908, #53960, #54070, #54129); Apache-2.0 may be combined into AGPL, not
the reverse. See LICENSE-NOTICE.md and CREDITS.md. 1093 changed lines
(git diff --numstat, summed).

